rue&quot;, &quot;code_status&quot;: &quot;Clear&quot;, &quot;type_of_violence&quot;: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;conflict_dset_id&quot;: &quot;&quot;, &quot;conflict_new_id&quot;: &quot;13243&quot;, &quot;conflict_name&quot;: &quot;Russia - Ukraine&quot;, &quot;dyad_dset_id&quot;: &quot;14117&quot;, &quot;dyad_new_id&quot;: &quot;14117&quot;, &quot;dyad_name&quot;: &quot;Government of Russia (Soviet Union) - Government of Ukraine&quot;, &quot;side_a_dset_id&quot;: &quot;57&quot;, &quot;side_a_new_id&quot;: &quot;57&quot;, &quot;side_a&quot;: &quot;Government of Russia (Soviet Union)&quot;, &quot;side_b_dset_id&quot;: &quot;61&quot;, &quot;side_b_new_id&quot;: &quot;61&quot;, &quot;side_b&quot;: &quot;Government of Ukraine&quot;, &quot;number_of_sources&quot;: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;source_article&quot;: &quot;\&quot;Ukrinform,2026-06-16,The enemy attacked Sloviansk: three people were killed , five were wounded\&quot;&quot;, &quot;source_office&quot;: &quot;Ukrinform&quot;, &quot;source_date&quot;: &quot;2026-06-16&quot;, &quot;source_headline&quot;: &quot;The enemy attacked Sloviansk: three people were killed , five were wounded&quot;, &quot;source_original&quot;: &quot;Ukraine (Russian troops attacked the Kherson region with drones, one person was killed and one was wounded .\nAs Ukrinform reports, the Kherson OVA reported this on Telegram .\n\nIt is noted that at about 2:00 p.m., Russian occupiers attacked the village of Virivka, Tyaginska community, with a drone. A 49-year-old man was hit by the enemy strike and sustained non-life-threatening injuries .\n\nAlso at approximately 3:20 p.m., Russians attacked a woman with a drone in the Dniprovs&apos;kyi district of Kherson . The 72-year-old Kherson woman was taken to the hospital with an explosive injury and shrapnel wounds to her head and torso.\n\nRead also: Two police officers injured in Kherson as a result of a second attack on a minibus\nIn addition, at around 3:00 p.m., Russian invaders struck Nova Kamianka, Mylivska 